      "cr": 1,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Toriel.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, hand-authored from the article. XP ledger: level 1, power rating 2 → CR 1 as a priest. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>Royal Approval Authority of the Underground</strong> — Monster Underground Royal Family</p><p>Status: Active — co-authored the final secrecy oath before the Mount Ebott extraction</p><p>Toriel is one of the only named authorities Sans says can grant personal royal approval through the Underground's ancient seals.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Fire Hands</strong> — “Royal Approval Authority of the Underground”</li><li><strong>Royal Approval Authority</strong> — “Active — co-authored the final secrecy oath before the Mount Ebott extraction”</li><li><strong>Towering Presence</strong> — “Toriel materialized from the gloom like a specter given form, her towering silhouette cut stark against shafts of golden light piercing through the dense canopy above.”</li><li><strong>Healing Fire</strong> — “Toriel materialized from the gloom like a specter given form, her towering silhouette cut stark against shafts of golden light piercing through the dense canopy above.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/toriel</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/toriel</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
